- AllAuthorized: The full authorization scope, which is limited by the application address book authorization.
- SelectedDepartments: The selected departments and all their sub-departments.
When you explicitly submit syncScope, you must provide a valid mode, which is verified by the backend.', example='SelectedDepartments'),
    }(name='syncScope', description='Retains the department-based synchronization scope definition. If this parameter is omitted during creation, the default value is AllAuthorized, and the first vendor synchronization is determined by syncOnBind. If this parameter is omitted or set to null during an update, the original value is retained. Updating and saving the scope does not automatically perform full synchronization.'),
  }(name='body', description='The request content for binding an external identity provider.', shrink='json', position='Body'),
}

