      }
    ](name='agenticFsMounts', description='The list of additional AgenticFS mounts. The total number of AgenticFS mounts and ossMounts cannot exceed 10. During creation, omitting this field or passing an empty array [] indicates no additional mounts. During an update, omitting this field retains the original value, and passing an empty array [] clears the list. You cannot pass null.'),
