This parameter is required.', example='python main.py'),
        languageRuntime: string(name='languageRuntime', description='The code runtime environment identifier, such as python3.12. When creating or switching environments, use the identifier returned by the ListAgentCodeRuntimes operation. The identifier is validated by the current version catalog and is not a fixed enumeration.

