        sourceUri: string(name='sourceUri', description='The source address of the code package. This field supports oss:// addresses or HTTPS object addresses of standard OSS public domain names, including OSS signed URLs. Arbitrary external sites, custom domain names, and additional authentication request headers are not supported. After a local upload, use the sourceUri returned by the GetAgentCodePackageUploadUrl operation. The address is revalidated and transferred during creation or updates. After the transfer is saved, the platform returns a fixed oss:// address. This fixed address can be reused for regular updates.

This parameter is required.', example='oss://my-agent-bucket/packages/main.zip'),
      }(name='code', description='The code package deployment configuration. This field is mutually exclusive with the container field. Code packages use the ZIP or TAR.GZ format. Dependencies must be packaged by the user. The platform does not install dependencies or perform online builds.'),
